      ],
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "Kikuyu (Pennisetum clandestinum Hochst. ex Chiov) is a tropical grass from Eastern Africa that has been introduced in other tropical and subtropical areas. It is palatable, resistant to heavy grazing and mostly used for pasture. [Feedipedia]",
        "@language": "en"
