          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "Subclover (Trifolium subterraneum L.) is a much valued annual legume forage used in ruminant production systems, particularly in drylands. It is particularly suited to grazing and can be cut for silage and hay. [Feedipedia]",
        "@language": "en"
      },
