      ],
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "Congo grass (Brachiaria ruziziensis Germ. & Evrard or Urochloa ruziziensis (R. Germ. & C.M. Evrard) Crins) is an important tropical forage grass. [Feedipedia]",
